      en: "Guneid was the first modern sugar factory in Sudan and processes sugarcane from the Gezira region. Oldest sugar factory in Sudan. Founded in the 1960s. Center in Gezira. Important industrial heritage. Thus, the site is among the characteristic points of Sudan along the Nile, the Nubian Desert and the Red Sea, and offers insight into the ancient Nubian heritage and the regional identity. Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan. The region is shaped by the Nile and the Nubian Desert."
