      en: "The refinery in El Obeid processes heavy crude oil from the western and southern oil fields into fuels and asphalt. Specializes in heavy oil. Important asphalt producer. Supplies Kordofan and Darfur. Built in the 1990s. Thus, the site is among the characteristic points of Sudan along the Nile, the Nubian Desert and the Red Sea, and offers insight into the ancient Nubian heritage and the regional identity. Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan. The region is shaped by the Nile and the Nubian Desert."
