      en: "The Balila Oil Field in Block 6 is one of the most active oil-producing areas in Sudan and primarily produces heavy crude oil. Extracts highly viscous oil. Connected to Khartoum by pipeline. Operated by PetroEnergy. Important for the El Obeid refinery. Thus, the site is among the characteristic points of Sudan along the Nile, the Nubian Desert and the Red Sea, and offers insight into the ancient Nubian heritage and the regional identity. Located in the Northeast African state of Sudan."
